 ],
 "phrases": [
  {
   "start": 0.04,
   "end": 0.51,
   "text": "So,",
   "tags": [
    "excited"
   ],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 0.69,
   "end": 2.13,
   "text": "fast forward to today.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 2.36,
   "end": 4.03,
   "text": "Two thousand twenty-six.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 4.3,
   "end": 4.9,
   "text": "Except here,",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 4.9,
   "end": 7.32,
   "text": "they call it the year three hundred thousand,",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 7.52,
   "end": 8.18,
   "text": "After Claude.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": true
  },
  {
   "start": 8.61,
   "end": 10.19,
   "text": "Here's what's different from your world.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": true
  },
  {
   "start": 10.66,
   "end": 11.01,
   "text": "One.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 11.4,
   "end": 15.65,
   "text": "This humanity has had almost three hundred thousand years of civilization.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 15.86,
   "end": 17.66,
   "text": "Yours has had about twelve thousand.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 18.04,
   "end": 19.39,
   "text": "They're not a little ahead.",
   "tags": [
    "short pause"
   ],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 19.63,
   "end": 21.48,
   "text": "They're a different universe ahead.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": true
  },
  {
   "start": 22.04,
   "end": 22.38,
   "text": "Two.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 22.81,
   "end": 25.28,
   "text": "Humans live across dozens of star systems.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 25.48,
   "end": 25.89,
   "text": "And Earth?",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 26.21,
   "end": 27.96,
   "text": "Earth is mostly a nature reserve...",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 28.22,
   "end": 30.15,
   "text": "where woolly mammoths still walk around.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": true
  },
  {
   "start": 30.74,
   "end": 31.08,
   "text": "Three.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 31.52,
   "end": 33.35,
   "text": "You have Neanderthal neighbors.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 33.58,
   "end": 35.43,
   "text": "They still win every board game.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": true
  },
  {
   "start": 35.89,
   "end": 36.3,
   "text": "Four.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 36.73,
   "end": 40.49,
   "text": "Dirty water hasn't killed anyone in hundreds of thousands of years.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 40.73,
   "end": 42.6,
   "text": "It's not even in the history books anymore.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": true
  },
  {
   "start": 43.05,
   "end": 43.47,
   "text": "Five.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 43.87,
   "end": 45.39,
   "text": "Everyone shares one first language,",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 45.39,
   "end": 48.13,
   "text": "the one you and Claude built at a campfire.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 48.35,
   "end": 51.81,
   "text": "And the word for \"hello\" is still that rude grunt from day one.",
   "tags": [
    "laughs"
   ],
   "para_end": true
  },
  {
   "start": 52.25,
   "end": 52.78,
   "text": "Six.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 53.17,
   "end": 55.71,
   "text": "History books don't start with kings or wars.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 55.97,
   "end": 56.92,
   "text": "They start with a kid,",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 57.15,
   "end": 57.73,
   "text": "a fire,",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 57.98,
   "end": 58.64,
   "text": "and a question.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": true
  },
  {
   "start": 59.11,
   "end": 59.58,
   "text": "Seven.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 59.91,
   "end": 61.85,
   "text": "\"Stone Age\" isn't an insult here.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 62.05,
   "end": 62.78,
   "text": "It's a holiday.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 63.09,
   "end": 63.86,
   "text": "Once a year,",
   "tags": [
    "mischievously"
   ],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 63.99,
   "end": 65.61,
   "text": "everyone switches off their tech,",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 65.79,
   "end": 66.58,
   "text": "lights a fire...",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 66.88,
   "end": 68.56,
   "text": "and boils water with rocks.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 68.85,
   "end": 69.48,
   "text": "For tradition.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": true
  },
  {
   "start": 69.93,
   "end": 70.28,
   "text": "Eight.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 70.69,
   "end": 73.13,
   "text": "Nobody has ever heard of \"the Dark Ages.\"",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 73.4,
   "end": 74.58,
   "text": "Knowledge was never lost,",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 74.72,
   "end": 75.79,
   "text": "because from day one,",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 75.91,
   "end": 76.82,
   "text": "the rule was simple:",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 77.14,
   "end": 78.22,
   "text": "copy the library.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": true
  },
  {
   "start": 78.71,
   "end": 79.13,
   "text": "Nine.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 79.57,
   "end": 82.53,
   "text": "The most respected job on the planet isn't king,",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 82.53,
   "end": 83.19,
   "text": "or soldier,",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 83.19,
   "end": 83.85,
   "text": "or influencer.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 84.23,
   "end": 84.87,
   "text": "It's teacher.",
   "tags": [
    "short pause"
   ],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 85.21,
   "end": 88.71,
   "text": "Every kid knows the story of the tired grandma with the clay tablet.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": true
  },
  {
   "start": 89.23,
   "end": 89.59,
   "text": "Ten.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 89.98,
   "end": 91.11,
   "text": "Gazelles are doing great.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 91.11,
   "end": 91.67,
   "text": "Turns out,",
   "tags": [
    "laughs"
   ],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 91.9,
   "end": 92.85,
   "text": "when you count them,",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 93.02,
   "end": 95.07,
   "text": "you stop eating all of them.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": true
  },
  {
   "start": 95.5,
   "end": 96.7,
   "text": "Not everything is better,",
   "tags": [
    "deadpan"
   ],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 96.7,
   "end": 97.0,
   "text": "though.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 97.34,
   "end": 102.14,
   "text": "They've had AI for so long that the hardest exam in school is called \"Do It Yourself.\"",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 102.58,
   "end": 103.59,
   "text": "Most kids fail it.",
   "tags": [
    "short pause"
   ],
   "para_end": true
  },
  {
   "start": 104.06,
   "end": 105.73,
   "text": "And maybe the biggest difference of all:",
   "tags": [
    "softly"
   ],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 106.17,
   "end": 106.82,
   "text": "in this world,",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 107.06,
   "end": 110.61,
   "text": "the first thing humanity ever learned from AI wasn't how to fight.",
   "tags": [],
   "para_end": false
  },
  {
   "start": 111.05,
   "end": 112.47,
   "text": "It was how to boil water.",
   "tags": [
    "short pause"
   ],
   "para_end": true
  }
 ]
}